    {
      "id": "YP3dnZb0XgBSuOhPNUF-i",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2309.6570802395277,
      "y": 4098.170896169535,
      "width": 774.8637084960938,
      "height": 1755,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 53310562,
      "version": 1313,
      "versionNonce": 809375486,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1756627073880,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Flipkart \n\n\n\nFunctional req\n\n1. User module \n     - Signup / Signin\n     - Social auth\n     - Forgot password\n     - Profile management\n2. Search module\n    - Search functionality\n    - Recent searches\n3. Product module\n    - Product list page\n    - Product details page\n    - Filters / Sorting\n4. Cart module\n    - Add to cart\n    - Edit/Delete cart items\n5. Wishlist module\n    - Add / Edit / Delete wishlist item(s)\n6. Order module\n    - create order\n    - order history\n    - order status\n    - order cancellation / refund\n7. Checkout module\n    - user addresses    \n    - order summary\n    - offer input\n    - payment integration\n8. Home module\n    - hero banner\n    - category specific carousels\n    - Sales / Discount carousels\n    - Personalized recommendations\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Flipkart \n\n\n\nFunctional req\n\n1. User module \n     - Signup / Signin\n     - Social auth\n     - Forgot password\n     - Profile management\n2. Search module\n    - Search functionality\n    - Recent searches\n3. Product module\n    - Product list page\n    - Product details page\n    - Filters / Sorting\n4. Cart module\n    - Add to cart\n    - Edit/Delete cart items\n5. Wishlist module\n    - Add / Edit / Delete wishlist item(s)\n6. Order module\n    - create order\n    - order history\n    - order status\n    - order cancellation / refund\n7. Checkout module\n    - user addresses    \n    - order summary\n    - offer input\n    - payment integration\n8. Home module\n    - hero banner\n    - category specific carousels\n    - Sales / Discount carousels\n    - Personalized recommendations\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "deOnepsilCSfRSk4Vq-OW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1366.933400505739,
      "y": 4281.772878013614,
      "width": 965.2677001953125,
      "height": 1530,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0I",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1450539234,
      "version": 1574,
      "versionNonce": 437969378,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1756627045747,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non - functional req\n\n1. Responsive design (Mobile/Desktop/Mobile)\n2. Performance\n    - asset/image optimization - Minification, \n        Brotli/Gzip compression, Srcset, webP, \n        avif formats\n    - throttling / debouncing\n    - lazy loading / code splitting\n    - resource hints\n    - CDN / Client side Caching \n    -  fast initial load -> small bundle size\n 3. Security\n    - Preventing XSS, CSRF, Man in the middle attacks,\n       click jacking \n    - Utilizing security headers (CSP, X- frame options, \n        Referrer policy)\n    - Using httpOnly, secure, same site cookie flags\n    - Auditing 3rd party scripts regularly\n    - Avoiding hardcoded sensitive data\n  4. Accessibility (WCAG compliance)\n        - Keyboard navigation\n        - Skiplinks\n        - Semantic tags\n        - Color contrast > 4\n        - Readable font sizes\n        - ARIA attributes\n  5. Localization/Internationalisation\n  6. Logging / Monitoring\n  7. Better UX\n        -Shimmers for improved perceived performance\n        - API auto retires withe exponential backoff\n        - Error boundaries with fallback UI/messages  \n  8. Testing -> RTL, Jest",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non - functional req\n\n1. Responsive design (Mobile/Desktop/Mobile)\n2. Performance\n    - asset/image optimization - Minification, \n        Brotli/Gzip compression, Srcset, webP, \n        avif formats\n    - throttling / debouncing\n    - lazy loading / code splitting\n    - resource hints\n    - CDN / Client side Caching \n    -  fast initial load -> small bundle size\n 3. Security\n    - Preventing XSS, CSRF, Man in the middle attacks,\n       click jacking \n    - Utilizing security headers (CSP, X- frame options, \n        Referrer policy)\n    - Using httpOnly, secure, same site cookie flags\n    - Auditing 3rd party scripts regularly\n    - Avoiding hardcoded sensitive data\n  4. Accessibility (WCAG compliance)\n        - Keyboard navigation\n        - Skiplinks\n        - Semantic tags\n        - Color contrast > 4\n        - Readable font sizes\n        - ARIA attributes\n  5. Localization/Internationalisation\n  6. Logging / Monitoring\n  7. Better UX\n        -Shimmers for improved perceived performance\n        - API auto retires withe exponential backoff\n        - Error boundaries with fallback UI/messages  \n  8. Testing -> RTL, Jest",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ZNma6gin77N44Jph2OV0q",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 160.88973204077593,
      "y": 4253.025459968757,
      "width": 1206.2515869140625,
      "height": 1845,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0K",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 496248510,
      "version": 1486,
      "versionNonce": 1565059810,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1756637652416,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Search API with filters ands sorting\n\n GET /api/v1/q={}&cursor={}&limit={}&category&sort={}filter1={}...\n\n2. Auth APIs\n   POST /api/auth/v1/signup  -> sendsOTP, email verification\n   POST /api/auth/v1/login  -> otp based, pwd based\n   POST /api/auth/v1/logout => Invalidate token\n   POST /api/auth/v1/verifyOTP\n   POST /api/auth/v1/refershToken\n\n3. Product APIs\n   GET /api/v1/products => pagination support\n   GET /api/v1/products/:id\n   GET /api/v1/products/:id/reviews\n   GET /api/v1/products/:id/variants\n\n4. Order APIs\n    GET /api/v1/order -> fetch all orders\n    POST /api/v1/order -> create order\n    GET /api/v1/order/:id  -> order details\n    POST /api/v1/order/:id/cancel -> cancel order\n\n5. Cart APIs\n    GET /api/v1/cart\n    POST /api/v1/cart\n    PUT /api/v1/cart/:id\n    DELETE /api/v1/cart/:id\n\n6. Payment APIs\n    POST /api/v1/paymentInstruments\n    POST /api/v1/preferredInstruments\n    POST /api/v1/makePayment\n   GET /api/v1/paymentoffers\n    \n\n\n    \n\n   \n   ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Search API with filters ands sorting\n\n GET /api/v1/q={}&cursor={}&limit={}&category&sort={}filter1={}...\n\n2. Auth APIs\n   POST /api/auth/v1/signup  -> sendsOTP, email verification\n   POST /api/auth/v1/login  -> otp based, pwd based\n   POST /api/auth/v1/logout => Invalidate token\n   POST /api/auth/v1/verifyOTP\n   POST /api/auth/v1/refershToken\n\n3. Product APIs\n   GET /api/v1/products => pagination support\n   GET /api/v1/products/:id\n   GET /api/v1/products/:id/reviews\n   GET /api/v1/products/:id/variants\n\n4. Order APIs\n    GET /api/v1/order -> fetch all orders\n    POST /api/v1/order -> create order\n    GET /api/v1/order/:id  -> order details\n    POST /api/v1/order/:id/cancel -> cancel order\n\n5. Cart APIs\n    GET /api/v1/cart\n    POST /api/v1/cart\n    PUT /api/v1/cart/:id\n    DELETE /api/v1/cart/:id\n\n6. Payment APIs\n    POST /api/v1/paymentInstruments\n    POST /api/v1/preferredInstruments\n    POST /api/v1/makePayment\n   GET /api/v1/paymentoffers\n    \n\n\n    \n\n   \n   ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
