      "text": "Entites:\n   \n1. User\n    - id\n    - email\n    - name\n    - password hash\n    - phone\n\n2. Product\n    - id\n    - name\n    - description\n    - rating\n    - price\n    - images\n    - sizes\n    - brand\n    - categoryId\n    - reviewCount\n\n3. Variants\n    - id\n    - productId\n    - color\n    - size\n    - stock\n\n4. Order\n    - id\n    - userId\n    - totalPrice\n    - status\n    - createdAt date\n    - shippingTo address\n   \n    \n5. Order item\n    - id\n    - priceAtPurchase\n    - orderId\n    - status\n    - productId\n    - variantId\n    - quantity\n\n\n     \n",
